# Registry auth deliberately lives OUTSIDE this file. pnpm 11 ignores
# _authToken lines in a project .npmrc and will not expand ${VARS} in them,
# because this file is committed. Put credentials in your user-level
# ~/.npmrc (where ${VARS} ARE expanded) or use `pnpm config set`.
# See .env.example for the required tokens.
